Qwen RESEARCH LICENSE AGREEMENT (fixture placeholder)

This file is a placeholder that stands in for the upstream `LICENSE` of
`Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1` in the miniature parity snapshot. It is not the licence
text. The real snapshot ships the Qwen Research License Agreement, and a
converted tier must carry it (Qwen Research License section 3). This file
exists only so tests can check that the converter's `copy_turnkey_assets`
step carries a root `LICENSE` into every converted tier and lists it in
`SHA256SUMS` (sc-24114).
